Private key:

This fixture deliberately carries no secret material. The success test must
produce zero findings offline: it used to hold the same private key and a
basic-auth URL as the bad fixtures, and only differed by the credential
failing to authenticate, which made the whole test depend on a third-party
endpoint staying reachable from the CI runner.

See the bad fixtures for the detected counterparts.
